OL,3,GNEWSAVoters head to polls for Isle of
OL,4,AMan general election
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoting has begun in the 2026 Isle of
OL,7,FMan general election.
OL,9,FPolling stations across the island
OL,10,Fopened at 08:00 BST, with voters having
OL,11,Funtil 20:00 to cast their votes.
OL,13,FVoters will elect 24 members of the
OL,14,FHouse of Keys, two in each of the 12
OL,15,Fconstituencies, who will serve in Manx
OL,16,Fparliament for the next five years.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
