OL,3,GNEWSAVoters head to polls for Isle of
OL,4,AMan general election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are a total of 82 candidates
OL,7,Fcontesting the election across the
OL,8,Fisland. For the first time, voters can
OL,9,Fvote at any polling station within the
OL,10,Fboundary of the constituency they live
OL,11,Fin.
